      "title": "Company Training Institute 1",
      "content": "Company: Training Institute\r\nCourse Name: Java Programming\r\nCourse Category: Programming & Software Development\r\n\r\nSummary:\r\nComprehensive Java training program covering programming fundamentals, object-oriented programming (OOP), JDBC database connectivity, web development fundamentals, and hands-on Spring Boot application development.\r\n\r\nKey Course Details:\r\n- Course: Java Programming\r\n- Duration: 3 Months\r\n- Total Hours: 2 hours per day, Monday to Friday\r\n- Course Fee: INR 25,000 (Full payment or approved installment options available)\r\n- Training Mode: Online live interactive classes and Classroom sessions\r\n- Eligibility: Beginners and students with basic computer knowledge. No prior programming experience required.\r\n- Target Audience: Students, fresh graduates, job seekers, beginners, and working professionals.\r\n- Certification: Official Course Completion Certificate provided upon finishing training and projects.\r\n- Admission Status: Admissions are currently open.\r\n\r\nClass Schedules & Batch Timings:\r\n- Frequency: Monday to Friday (2 hours/day)\r\n- Morning Batch: 9:00 AM to 11:00 AM IST\r\n- Afternoon Batch: 2:00 PM to 4:00 PM IST\r\n- Evening Batch: 6:00 PM to 8:00 PM IST\r\n\r\nCurriculum & Topics Covered:\r\n1. Java Fundamentals & Environment Setup (JDK, IDEs)\r\n2. Variables, Data Types, Operators, Expressions\r\n3. Control Flow (Conditional Statements, Loops & Iteration)\r\n4. Data Structures (Arrays, Strings, Collections Framework: List, Set, Map, Generics)\r\n5. Methods, Functions, and Exception Handling\r\n6. Object-Oriented Programming (Classes, Objects, Constructors, Inheritance, Polymorphism, Encapsulation, Abstraction, Interfaces, Packages)\r\n7. File Handling & Multithreading\r\n8. Database Integration (JDBC & MySQL)\r\n9. Web Development Basics & REST API Fundamentals\r\n10. Introduction to Spring Boot Framework\r\n11. Practical Java Application Development\r\n\r\nHands-on Projects:\r\n1. Student Management System\r\n2. Library Management System\r\n3. Employee Management System\r\n4. Online Course Management System\r\n\r\nContact & Admissions:\r\n- Phone: +91 91213 75668\r\n- Email: info@example.com\r\n- Location / Address: Hyderabad, Telangana, India",
